        "original_id": "5aede544-bca6-5e81-9ec6-64f7928de94a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cid Corman, Elswyth Thane\n- Roles: poet, translator, editor, romance novelist\n- Publications: Origin\n- Topics: American poetry, American literature\n\nFacts:\n- Helen Elswyth Thane Ricker Beebe, known as Elswyth Thane, was born on May 16, 1900, and was an American romance novelist.\n- Cid Corman, born Sidney Corman, was born on June 29, 1924, and was an American poet, translator, and editor.\n- Cid Corman was most notable as the editor of \"Origin\" and was a key figure in the history of American poetry in the second half of the 20th century.\n- Elswyth Thane died on July 31, 1984.\n- Cid Corman died on March 12, 2004.",
